   Karwinkel, Thiemo; Winklhofer, Michael; Christoph, Paula; Allenstein, Dario; Schmaljohann, Heiko, Carl von Ossietzky Univ Oldenburg, Inst Biol \& Environm Sci IBU, Carl Von Ossietzky Str 9-11, D-26129 Oldenburg, Germany.
